OL,3,GNEWSAHull footpath closed over safety
OL,4,Afears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular walking route in Hull will
OL,7,Fremain closed for up to six months due
OL,8,Fto safety concerns, the city council
OL,9,Fhas said.
OL,11,FThe Albert Dock footpath, which runs
OL,12,Fbetween Wellington Street and a point
OL,13,Fadjacent to Dunston Ship Repairs Ltd,
OL,14,Fforms part of the Trans Pennine Trail
OL,15,Fand the King Charles III England Coast
OL,16,FPath.
OL,18,FAssociated British Ports (ABP), which
OL,19,Fowns the land, closed the walkway as a
OL,20,Fprecaution on 28 August following
OL,21,Fengineering advice.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
